# {PROJECT_TITLE} Tasks

Typed tasks live under `tasks/` and are governed by `registry/project.json`.
Create them with:

```bash
agentic-workspace/spec-kit/bin/project-kit create <project> task --title "<done-oriented title>"
```

Each task records scope, owner, dependencies, done condition, evidence, and
cycle. Do not mark a task done because work was attempted.
